      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg help my eye hurts so bad i think some of that heavy duty degreaser from the garage splashed in it while im cleaning. it stings like crazy and is all red. should i just rub it out to get the stuff out or like can i just put those homeopathic eye soothing drops in my cabinet to calm it down?? im kinda scared to go to the er if it isnt a big deal",
